# DIAGNOSTIC (study 4's r12/#14, still so): a join piece that is a parenthesized expression without '$' is
# "expected '(', found ')'" (at a line's end "found end of line"); after a name or a call E11b says "write '$...'".
fn main() ? {
    s := 125
    println($(s / 60) ":" (s % 60).PadStart(2, '0'))
}
